<title>UK: CE says holds 50.13 pct of Northern.</title>
<headline>CE says holds 50.13 pct of Northern.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group CE Electric said on Monday it held 50.13 percent of its hostile bid target Northern Electric by 1200 GMT on December 22, up from 50.03 percent on December 21.</p>
<p>The hotly-contested bid had an original deadline of 1300 GMT on December 20, when CE had 49.77 percent of the company, but the UK takeover panel stepped in to extend the deadline to 1300 GMT on December 24 and Northern has indicated it wishes to appeal the decision.</p>
</text>
